<title>RUSSIA: Russia to sell 10 trln rbls of 6-mth bills Oct 9.</title>
<headline>Russia to sell 10 trln rbls of 6-mth bills Oct 9.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's finance ministry will offer 10 trillion roubles of six-month GKO discount Treasury bills at an auction on October 9, the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) said on Wednesday.</p>
